{"id":"profundo","lemma":"profundo","pos":"adj","rank":1297,"glosses":["deep (having a bottom far from the surface or mouth)","profound (displaying great insight)"],"ipa":"/pɾoˈfundo/","forms":{"feminine":"profunda","masculinePlural":"profundos","femininePlural":"profundas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/af/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-profundo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Cava un agujero profundo.","en":"Dig a deep hole.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/707231"},{"text":"El agua es profunda.","en":"This water is deep.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501378"},{"text":"¿Cómo de profundos son los cortes?","en":"How deep are the cuts?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77056"},{"text":"Te estás metiendo en aguas profundas.","en":"You're getting into deep water.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/703820"},{"text":"¿El lago es profundo?","en":"Is the lake deep?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442865"}]}